          "message": {
            "text": "Every supplied bearer token creates a new `PyJWKClient`, discarding both JWKS and key caches. An unauthenticated caller can make each valid-shaped token perform a synchronous JWKS request, while an unknown `kid` forces a second refresh before the request is rejected."
          },
